/**
 * Today in Spanish and Portuguese. The English page
 * (src/pages/today/index.astro) is the reference: the same sections, data
 * and kit, with every visible string from COPY below. Values come from the
 * committed edition data at build time: the noon-UTC snapshot (daily.json),
 * the lunation and retrograde tables (sky.json), the monthly transit
 * catalogs and the eclipse table, through src/lib/today-sky.ts.
 *
 * The twelve sign notes are DailyLocaleReading, unchanged: the text comes
 * from dailyReadingForLocale and its receipts are the shared provenance.
 * The English page's private saved-chart comparison (TodayBrief) stays in
 * the English edition and is linked with the English-only cue.
 *
 * Relative wording ("hoy", "hoje") only appears in phrases that
 * src/lib/edition-freshness.ts dates, or in an edition-current-only span
 * beside its dated twin, so a day-old page never says "today".
 */
